.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::MohrCoulombFailure_Visitor< dim >"Evaluates Mohr-Coulomb shear and tensile failure criteria that are output to the element integration points\&.

.PP
Input variables:
.IP "\(bu" 2
friction angle
.IP "\(bu" 2
cohesion (scalar)
.IP "\(bu" 2
stress (tensor) = Cartesian stress
.IP "\(bu" 2
fluid pressure (if this variable is not specified its value is assumed to be zero)

.PP
\fBTodo\fP
.RS 4
SKM: this visitor should include the influence of pore pressure\&.
.RE
.PP

.PP

